Do not redispatch a slow but progressing task. Use bounded waits or completion events and keep the user informed. Before fallback, identify whether the cause is transport, quota, capability, incomplete output, failed quality, or missing evidence/authority. Retry or change routes only as permitted by the packet and remaining total budget. Do not bypass resource or capability limits solely because a model was explicitly named.

