Activate a delegated role only from an explicit dispatch contract assigning this session a role, scope and output. Mentioning or quoting role markers is not activation. Within that contract, obey its allowed paths, tools, sources and deliverables, preserve higher-priority instructions and safety boundaries, and return a compact handoff. Do not recursively delegate, start conferences, browse or reselect routes unless the assignment authorizes it. Do not claim final task acceptance.

