25:Use an independent conference node before closing a substantive high-consequence judgment with material interpretive uncertainty, a material disagreement unresolved by source/artefact checks, or a consequential subjective acceptance decision for which deterministic and direct inspection are insufficient. An explicit request for an independent model review also triggers it. Routine wording, language, file format, tool-step count and a Controlled label alone do not. Absence of material uncertainty must be supported by decisive source or artifact checks, not model confidence. If required review cannot run or the user requests solo work, record the limitation; perform available source/tool checks without claiming independent review or implying missing profession…
